    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Hight Schedules\nFREIGHT RATES FARES\nGUINEA\nAIRWAYS LIMITED\n132 NORTH TCE., ADELAIDE\nTELEPHONE LA 0461 (Continuous Service)\nEFFECTIVE Ist SEPTEMBER, 1951\n(Cancelling previous schedules)",
      "GUINEA\nAIRWAYS LIMITED\n132 NORTH, TCE., ADELAIDE\nTELEPHONE LA 0461 (Continuous Service)\nGENERAL INFORMATION\nRESERVATIONS should be made well in advance, and tickets\ntaken\nout immediately reservations are confirmed.\nReserva-\ntions for unticketed passengers will be held only for a reason-\nable time: if a passenger fails to purchase ticket by the\n\"time limit\" agreed upon, the reservation may be cancelled\nand resold.\nCANCELLATION FEES may be deducted from refunds of\nfares paid for reservations subsequently cancelled. Fees vary\naccording to length of time between notification of cancel.\nlation and departure time of service.\nBREAK OF JOURNEY on through tickets is not permitted.\nTickets will be issued for separate stages at fares published.\nGROUND TRANSPORT, unless otherwise stated, is included\nin cost of air ticket. Passengers are requested to be present\nat the office of departure at least 15 minutes before departure\nof the coach, or if proceeding to aerodrome by private means\nof transport, 15 minutes before aircraft departure in order\nthat tickets and baggage may be checked.\nBAGGAGE allowance of 35 Ibs. carried free for each pas-\nsenger, including children paying half fare. No allowance for\nchildren travelling free.\nExcess baggage charged at freight\nrates.\nEach passenger may carry handbag, rug, overcoat,\ncamera, and books free of charge.\nPASSENGER INSURANCE-Every passenger is automatically\ninsured free of charge for £2,000, payable in the event of\ndeath caused by accident.\nGRATUITIES-Passengers are reminded that the staff of\nGuinea Airways is not permitted to accept tips.\nSMOKING is permitted except during take-off\nand landing.\nPassengers are asked not to smoke\ncigars or pipes.\nCONDITIONS OF CARRIAGE are printed on\nevery flight ticket issued by the Company.\nAGENTS\nKINGSCOTE\nAMERICAN RIVER\nPENNESHAW\nPORT\nLINCOLN\nCOWELL\nCLEVE\nPORT PIRIE\nWHYALLA\nWOOMERA\nRENMARK\nBERRI\nMILDURA\nBROKEN\nD.\nH.\nL.\nShepherd\n'Phone\n29\nStockel\nR.\nR.\nG.\nB.\nNoack\nWearne\n223\nJ.\nPayne\n\u0026 Co.\nBennett \u0026 Fisher Ltd.\nHarrison \u0026 Goode\nJ.\nA.\nNelson\nDept of Supply\nJ.\n(Extn.\nM\nH.\nE.\nG\n50)\nThompson\nHall \u0026\nCo.\nChaffey \u0026\nHILL\nCo.\nBranch i\nOffice: Cnr.\nAr-\ngent and Bromide Sts.\n283\n14\n1000\n956\n084"
    ],
